    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d354">

                <pb facs="1555" n="1493" sameAs="frus:frus1945v01/pg1493"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.CC(PC)/12–2345: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting United States Representative on the
                        Preparatory Commission</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Stevenson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Acting Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-12-23">December 23,
                        1945</date>.<lb/>[Received December 23—3:56 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>13454. Copre 654. The Preparatory Commission concluded its work and adjourned at
                    5 p.m. today after approving remaining committee reports and other portions of
                    final report.<anchor n="59" xml:id="d354-f1"/> The final meetings were concluded
                    speedily and the atmosphere was cordial and optimistic.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stevenson</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d354-f1" n="59" xml:id="d354-f1-content">
                <p>See Preparatory Commission document PC/20: <hi rendition="#italic">Report of the
                        Preparatory Commission of the United Nations</hi>, December 23, 1945.</p>
            </note>
